#. module: project_block_picking
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:project_block_picking.field_project_project__block_picking
msgid "Block pickings"
msgstr "Bloquear albaranes"

#. module: project_block_picking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:project_block_picking.field_project_project__block_picking
msgid ""
"If enabled, stock moves cannot be added or edited on pickings linked to a "
"task of this project."
msgstr ""
"Si se activa, no se podrán añadir ni editar movimientos de stock en los "
"albaranes vinculados a una tarea de este proyecto."

#. module: project_block_picking
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:project_block_picking.field_stock_picking__picking_blocked
msgid "Picking blocked"
msgstr "Albarán bloqueado"

#. module: project_block_picking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:project_block_picking.field_stock_picking__picking_blocked
msgid ""
"Stock moves cannot be added or edited when the linked task is blocked or its "
"project blocks pickings, is archived or is in a folded stage."
msgstr ""
"No se pueden añadir ni editar movimientos de stock cuando la tarea vinculada "
"está bloqueada o su proyecto bloquea los albaranes, está archivado o está en "
"una etapa plegada."

